2026-11-01T03:27:17.5579964Z             'INTERNAL_CONTROL routes are service-to-service; never ship internal '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5580162Z             'credentials in Android. Owner intent must use a supported signed '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5580269Z             'owner/session path.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5580500Z             'ATTESTED_ARTIFACT_PROVIDER routes require HTTPS and the actual '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5580708Z             'TLS-verified client leaf matched to a current provider/owner/project '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5580901Z             'pin, plus an exact fresh signed admission and current execution '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581094Z             'introspection. Owner device credentials, forwarded identity headers '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581290Z             'and static internal bearers cannot authorize this separate service '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581491Z             'lane; Android uses only owner draft/read/cancel and signed A4 command '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581565Z             'routes.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581766Z             'Proof requirements come from actual middleware and apply when device '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5581959Z             'binding is enforced; mTLS is an additional transport/device gate on '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5582057Z             'the direct listener.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5582259Z             'The session WebSocket uses a paired-device token and an owned session '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5582459Z             'ID. A bound-device handshake proof is required unless verified mTLS '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5582744Z             'supplies the same device identity; the session ID is not a second '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5582839Z             'credential.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583043Z             'ARTEMIS session minting requires ingress and paired-device authority '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583226Z             'plus bound-device proof. A one-use launch token redeems a browser '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583423Z             'cookie; that cookie authorizes only the console resource predicate, '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583544Z             'with origin checks on mutations.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583720Z             'Request handlers may impose additional HMAC, owner signature, '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5583916Z             'approval, grant, ownership, freshness and scope checks; endpoint '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5584038Z             'existence grants no authority.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5584215Z             'OpenAPI does not enumerate every runtime/domain refusal. Feature '
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5584401Z             'acceptance contracts define UI recovery and evidence states.',
2026-11-01T03:27:17.5584478Z         ],
